#ASSERT `Under section 63A(1), is the public company late in lodging the return of the allotment` TRUE TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 1 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the company is listed on an approved exchange in Singapore: the return need not state the particulars of the 50 largest members
#ASSERT `Under section 63A(2), need the return of allotment not state the particulars of the 50 largest members` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- an unlisted company is not covered by the relief
