-- none of the three kinds of allotment: the duty does not arise
#ASSERT `Under section 63B(3), is the company in default of the duty to lodge the document specified in subsection (4) with the return of allotment` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
