-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part sga2 (merged by the lead; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- Cases for sga2-seat.l4: one or more assertions for every question of the seat of a director, secretary, member or person dealing with a company.
-- Each expected value is written from the text of ss 76 and 76A (inputs/CoA1967.txt lines 7321-8311), beside the assertion, before the code was run.
-- The facts are those a real person in the seat would state. 5 October 2026 is a Monday; 26 October is 21 days after it.
-- An answer NOTHING means the text says nothing on those facts; JUST FALSE means the text says no in its own words (see NOTES.md, "Reading a result: FALSE and NOTHING (sga2)").

§ `Section 76(1) to (4): the prohibition`

