#ASSERT `Under section 76(8)(ga), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a representation, warranty or indemnity on an offer to the public` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8)(h): a purchase under an order of a Court.
