#ASSERT `Under section 76(8)(i), is the act one that subsections (1) and (1A) do not prohibit because it is a lien on shares that are not fully paid` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8)(j): an agreement with a subscriber for payment by instalments. Arguments: the act is the agreement; it permits instalments; good faith; ordinary course.
