§ `Sections 206 to 208A: the auditor's remuneration, reports, powers and protection`

-- 206(1): arguments: served, requires the particulars, total members, members behind the notice, total shares, shares held by those behind the notice. 5 of 100 members; 4 is not enough; 50 of 1,000 shares.
#ASSERT `Under section 206(1), does the notice engage the duty of the company` TRUE TRUE 100 5 1000 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 206(1), does the notice engage the duty of the company` TRUE TRUE 100 4 1000 0 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 206(1), does the notice engage the duty of the company` TRUE TRUE 100 0 1000 50 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 206(1), does the notice engage the duty of the company` TRUE TRUE 100 0 1000 49 EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 206(1)(c), (d), (e): in default unless done, and done immediately.
