#ASSERT `Under section 206(1)(e), is the company in default of the duty to lay the statement before the company in general meeting` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- 206(1A): a public company in prescribed circumstances: review done and outcome sent, or not.
