§§ `Section 215: the compulsory acquisition of the shares of dissenting shareholders`

-- Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer?
-- Arguments: what the scheme involves; shares in issue (treasury included); held as treasury; issued after the offer (not on an option); relevant treasury shares that ceased; already held by the transferee; shares counted whose holders approved; day of offer; day of approval.
-- an offer made on 1 January 2026: 4 months after it ends on 1 May 2026; the window opens the day after the offer
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 0 0 0 0 900 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 0 0 0 0 900 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 2 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 0 0 0 0 900 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- 900 of 1,000 is exactly 90%; 899 is less
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 0 0 0 0 899 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- treasury shares are left out of the total: 810 of 900 is 90%, 809 is not
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 100 0 0 0 810 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 100 0 0 0 809 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the class limb also leaves out the shares the transferee already held (fork F-215-2): 630 of 700 is 90%, 630 of 800 is not
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_class 1000 100 50 50 100 630 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_all 1000 100 50 50 100 630 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a transfer of only some of the shares is outside the subsection
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), has the scheme or contract been approved by the holders of at least 90% of the shares within 4 months of the offer` sgdseat_inv_some 1000 0 0 0 0 900 (Date 1 1 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares?
-- Approved on 1 May 2026: 2 months after ends on 1 July 2026. Arguments: the approval is as (1) requires, the day approved, the day of the notice, dissenting, in the prescribed manner.
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 5 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 7 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 5 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` FALSE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not a dissenting shareholder: outside the grant
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- not in the prescribed manner: points outside the sources
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 1 6 2026) TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the period is tested before the person: a late notice to a person who is not dissenting is JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the transferee give me notice that it desires to acquire my shares` TRUE (Date 1 5 2026) (Date 2 7 2026) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court?
-- Arguments: the day the transferee gave the notice; I was supplied with the statement; the day it was supplied.
-- one month from 31 January 2026 ends on 28 February 2026 (the month has no 31st; keel convention P4)
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court` (Date 31 1 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)
-- "whichever is the later": 14 days from a statement supplied on 20 February 2026 end on 6 March 2026, later than 28 February
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court` (Date 31 1 2026) TRUE (Date 20 2 2026) EQUALS (Date 6 3 2026)
-- a statement supplied on 1 February: 14 days end on 15 February, earlier than 28 February
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), what is the last day on which I may apply to the Court` (Date 31 1 2026) TRUE (Date 1 2 2026) EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)

-- Under section 215(1), is my application to the Court within the time the subsection allows?
-- Arguments: the day of the notice; I was supplied with the statement; the day it was supplied; the day I applied.
