#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the Court order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire my shares` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(1), may the Court order that the transferee is not entitled and bound to acquire my shares` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Under section 215(1), is the transferee entitled and bound to acquire my shares?
-- Arguments of the entitlement: the notice was given, the application was in time, the Court thought fit to order otherwise.
