-- Notice given on 10 March 2026: one month from it ends on 10 April 2026. Arguments: the notice was given, the day of it, the day the written demand was served.
#ASSERT `Under section 215(2), am I entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement of the other dissenting shareholders` FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 215(2), am I entitled to require the transferor company to supply the statement of the other dissenting shareholders` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 4 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
